{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41835","headline":"献张义方常侍 · 李中","name":"献张义方常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雄飞看是逼嵓廊，逸思常闻不暂忘。\n公署静眠思水石，古屏闲展看潇湘。\n老来酒病虽然减，秋杪诗魔更是狂。\n乘兴有时招羽客，横琴移月啓茅堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}